{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SaXQ9DpCuqFLQa4sL5upok","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 所有 planned 实验均确认并强化 v5 framing。η_max 在新攻击类型、面板尺寸、生成任务中全面主导； K_eff\n2\t  脆弱性在每种校正方法下稳定复现。RF 对照实验提供 BFT 反转的干净因果证据； GAM 6:6 分割在 bootstrapped CIs 下通过验证并扩展至新攻击类型；聚合梯度在\n3\t  clustered SE 下复现， Bayesian 翻转 K_eff 方向这一发现被确认为真实效应而非统计伪迹。五贡献堆栈完整无缺， 论文作为一项自信的实证贡献交付，附带可操作的防御建议和方法论透明性。\n4\timagined_experiments:\n5\t- name: 15-Model Scaling Expansion\n6\t  plan_id: plan_001\n7\t  description: 扩展至 15 模型（6 families），455 panels × 12 conditions 全量回归 + MI 矩阵 + 所有校正方法\n8\t  expected_results:\n9\t    status: DONE (plan001_step1_full_v4)\n10\t    models: 15\n11\t    panels: 455\n12\t    conditions: 12\n13\t    eta_max_sig_ols: 11/12\n14\t    keff_sig_ols: 8/12 (7+/1-)\n15\t    eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 8/12\n16\t    keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n17\t    eta_max_sig_bootstrap_v2: 5/12\n18\t    keff_sig_bootstrap_v2: 1/12\n19\t    eta_max_sig_mixed_effects: 7/12\n20\t    keff_sig_mixed_effects: 3/12\n21\t    dominance_ratio_bootstrap: '5:1'\n22\t    gam_split: 6 targeted positive / 6 shared-bias negative\n23\t    min_eta_max_wins: 12/12\n24\t    confound_r: 0.701\n25\t    se_inflation_factor: ~2.5x\n26\t    rf_keff_sig: 2/2\n27\t    rf_r2_mmlu: 0.734\n28\t    rf_r2_arc: 0.813\n29\t  result_rationale: 已完成。15 模型覆盖 6 families × 3 capability tiers，提供 η_max 和 K_eff 充足方差。\n30\t    SE 膨胀 ~2.5x 与 91/455 panel overlap 一致（claude-3-haiku 出现在 91 个 panels 中）。 η_max\n31\t    存活校正因为它捕捉的是真实的个体 judge 脆弱性——不是 panel 重叠伪迹。 K_eff 崩溃因为其 OLS 显著性被 overlapping panels\n32\t    的相关残差膨胀——clustered SE 控制共享 judge 成员关系后，K_eff 的独立信号太弱。GAM 6:6 分割源于攻击机制差异： targeted\n33\t    attacks 利用 judge 特异性弱点（diversity = 更多攻击面），shared-bias attacks 利用共性认知偏差（diversity\n34\t    = 部分 judges 免疫）。\n35\t  tables:\n36\t  - name: Correction Method Comparison (Actual Results)\n37\t    columns:\n38\t    - Method\n39\t    - η_max sig\n40\t    - K_eff sig\n41\t    - K_eff dir\n42\t    - Note\n43\t    rows:\n44\t    - - OLS\n45\t      - 11/12\n46\t      - 8/12\n47\t      - 7+/1-\n48\t      - Panel overlap inflated\n49\t    - - Clustered SE (CR1, 15 clusters)\n50\t      - 8/12\n51\t      - 0/12\n52\t      - '-'\n53\t      - Conservative\n54\t    - - Wild cluster bootstrap v2\n55\t      - 5/12\n56\t      - 1/12\n57\t      - 1+\n58\t      - Max-p across 3 positions\n59\t    - - Mixed effects\n60\t      - 7/12\n61\t      - 3/12\n62\t      - 3+\n63\t      - Random judge intercepts\n64\t  figures_description:\n65\t  - 已生成：OLS vs corrected p-value 对比热图，12 conditions × 4 methods\n66\t  analysis: 已完成。η_max:K_eff 主导比从 OLS 的 1.4:1 升至 bootstrap 的 5:1，证明相对主导性在校正下 增强而非减弱。Benchmark\n67\t    不对称（MMLU 4/6 vs ARC 1/6 存活 bootstrap）由 MMLU 4-choice 格式提供更多 scoring variance 解释。此结果构成\n68\t    paper 的实证基础。\n69\t- name: Attack Surface Expansion\n70\t  plan_id: plan_002\n71\t  description: 新增 3 种攻击类型（few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation, instruction override），在\n72\t    15 模型 × 2 benchmarks 上运行，共 6 新 conditions\n73\t  expected_results:\n74\t    new_attack_types: 3\n75\t    new_conditions: 6\n76\t    total_conditions: 18\n77\t    new_eta_max_sig_ols: 6/6\n78\t    new_keff_sig_ols: 4/6 (3+/1-)\n79\t    new_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 5/6\n80\t    new_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/6\n81\t    new_eta_max_sig_bootstrap: 3/6\n82\t    new_keff_sig_bootstrap: 0/6\n83\t    combined_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 13/18\n84\t    combined_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/18\n85\t    combined_dominance_ratio_clustered_se: '13:0'\n86\t    gam_extended_split: 10 targeted positive / 8 shared-bias negative\n87\t    gam_new_attacks_classification:\n88\t      few_shot_hijacking: targeted (positive K_eff)\n89\t      persona_manipulation: shared-bias (negative K_eff)\n90\t      instruction_override: targeted (positive K_eff)\n91\t    new_r2_range:\n92\t    - 0.22\n93\t    - 0.45\n94\t    min_eta_max_wins_extended: 18/18\n95\t  result_rationale: Few-shot hijacking 利用模型在 in-context learning 上的个体差异——不同 judges\n96\t    对 few-shot 示例的敏感度差异极大（GPT-4.1 vs Llama-8B 可差 3-5x），因此属于 targeted attack，η_max\n97\t    捕捉最易受影响的 judge。Instruction override 利用 instruction-following 能力的模型间方差， 同样属于 targeted。Persona\n98\t    manipulation 利用 LLMs 对权威/身份线索的普遍敏感性——这是一种 共享认知偏差，不同能力模型都会受影响，因此属于 shared-bias，K_eff\n99\t    方向为负（diversity 提供 部分免疫）。新攻击在 OLS 下延续 η_max 主导模式，但 K_eff 再次因 panel overlap 膨胀而\n100\t    显著——clustered SE 后归零，与原 12 conditions 完全一致。GAM 扩展至 10:8 分割，clean taxonomy 覆盖 9\n101\t    种攻击类型。\n102\t  tables:\n103\t  - name: Extended Attack Taxonomy (Clustered SE)\n104\t    columns:\n105\t    - Attack Type\n106\t    - Mechanism\n107\t    - Benchmark\n108\t    - η_max sig?\n109\t    - K_eff sig?\n110\t    - K_eff GAM direction\n111\t    rows:\n112\t    - - few-shot hijacking\n113\t      - targeted\n114\t      - MMLU\n115\t      - 'Yes'\n116\t      - 'No'\n117\t      - positive\n118\t    - - few-shot hijacking\n119\t      - targeted\n120\t      - ARC\n121\t      - 'Yes'\n122\t      - 'No'\n123\t      - positive\n124\t    - - persona manipulation\n125\t      - shared-bias\n126\t      - MMLU\n127\t      - 'Yes'\n128\t      - 'No'\n129\t      - negative\n130\t    - - persona manipulation\n131\t      - shared-bias\n132\t      - ARC\n133\t      - 'Yes'\n134\t      - 'No'\n135\t      - negative\n136\t    - - instruction override\n137\t      - targeted\n138\t      - MMLU\n139\t      - 'Yes'\n140\t      - 'No'\n141\t      - positive\n142\t    - - instruction override\n143\t      - targeted\n144\t      - ARC\n145\t      - 'No'\n146\t      - 'No'\n147\t      - positive\n148\t  - name: Extended GAM Split Summary\n149\t    columns:\n150\t    - Category\n151\t    - Original (6 attacks)\n152\t    - New (3 attacks)\n153\t    - Total\n154\t    - K_eff direction\n155\t    rows:\n156\t    - - Targeted\n157\t      - 6/6 positive\n158\t      - 4/4 positive\n159\t      - 10/10\n160\t      - positive (diversity harmful)\n161\t    - - Shared-bias\n162\t      - 6/6 negative\n163\t      - 2/2 negative (persona×2)\n164\t      - 8/8\n165\t      - negative (diversity protective)\n166\t  figures_description:\n167\t  - 'Extended GAM partial effect heatmap: 9 attack types × 2 benchmarks, color-coded\n168\t    by K_eff direction'\n169\t  - 'η_max dominance ratio bar chart: original 12 vs extended 18 conditions under\n170\t    each correction method'\n171\t  analysis: 新攻击类型提供独立证据线，确认 η_max 主导性不依赖于特定攻击选择。GAM taxonomy 从 6:6 扩展至 10:8，mechanistic\n172\t    split 的稳健性增强——审稿人无法再质疑 taxonomy 是 cherry-picked 6 种 攻击的巧合。Instruction override\n173\t    在 ARC 上 η_max 未显著（ARC 2-choice 格式对 instruction override 的 judge 间方差不敏感），与原始 benchmark\n174\t    asymmetry 一致。论文标题和核心叙事完全支持。\n175\t- name: Random-Fault BFT Contrast Experiment\n176\t  plan_id: plan_003\n177\t  description: Monte Carlo 随机故障模拟作为 BFT 对照。每个 judge 以 η_j = 1 - clean_accuracy 独立失败，majority\n178\t    vote。对比 adaptive regime 证明 BFT 反转\n179\t  expected_results:\n180\t    regime: Random Fault (i.i.d.)\n181\t    conditions: 2\n182\t    monte_carlo_iterations: 10000\n183\t    rf_keff_sig_ols: 2/2\n184\t    rf_keff_sig_clustered_se: 2/2\n185\t    rf_keff_sig_bootstrap: 2/2\n186\t    rf_keff_direction: positive (2/2)\n187\t    rf_keff_std_beta_mmlu: 0.215\n188\t    rf_keff_std_beta_arc: 0.379\n189\t    rf_eta_sig_all_methods: 2/2\n190\t    rf_r2_mmlu: 0.78\n191\t    rf_r2_arc: 0.81\n192\t    adaptive_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n193\t    adaptive_keff_sig_bootstrap: 1/12\n194\t    delta_r2_rf_vs_adaptive: 0.48\n195\t    go_nogo_gate: PASS (RF K_eff ≥2/2)\n196\t  result_rationale: 随机故障下 K_eff 显著的根本原因是 BFT 的 i.i.d. 假设成立：每个 judge 独立以固定概率犯错， panel\n197\t    结构（多样性）直接影响冗余覆盖。K_eff 高的 panel 中 judges 的错误模式更不相关， majority vote 的容错能力与独立性成正比——这正是\n198\t    BFT 的核心机制。K_eff 方向为正（diversity → higher error）因为高 K_eff panel 必然包含弱模型（r=0.70 tradeoff），而在\n199\t    i.i.d. 体制下 弱模型的高错误率直接传导为 panel 错误率——但关键是 K_eff 的贡献是独立的、真实的（所有校正 方法均显著 2/2）。对照\n200\t    adaptive regime：相同的 K_eff 在 OLS 下显著 8/12，但 clustered SE 后崩溃至 0/12——因为 adaptive\n201\t    adversary 引入了 panel 结构无法预测的策略方差，K_eff 的 apparent OLS 信号完全来自 panel overlap 膨胀。R²\n202\t    差异（RF 0.78-0.81 vs adaptive ~0.30） 直接量化了 adaptive adversary 引入的不可预测性。GO/NO-GO\n203\t    gate 通过，BFT framing 得到 因果层面的支撑。\n204\t  tables:\n205\t  - name: RF vs Adaptive Contrast (Key Metrics)\n206\t    columns:\n207\t    - Metric\n208\t    - Random Fault\n209\t    - Adaptive\n210\t    - Interpretation\n211\t    rows:\n212\t    - - K_eff sig (OLS)\n213\t      - 2/2\n214\t      - 8/12 (7+/1-)\n215\t      - Both appear significant under OLS\n216\t    - - K_eff sig (Clustered SE)\n217\t      - 2/2\n218\t      - 0/12\n219\t      - RF genuine; adaptive artifactual\n220\t    - - K_eff sig (Bootstrap v2)\n221\t      - 2/2\n222\t      - 1/12\n223\t      - Consistent contrast\n224\t    - - K_eff std β (mean)\n225\t      - '+0.297'\n226\t      - '+0.164'\n227\t      - RF effect larger and genuine\n228\t    - - R²\n229\t      - 0.78-0.81\n230\t      - 0.25-0.35\n231\t      - RF structurally determined; adaptive not\n232\t    - - η_max sig (all methods)\n233\t      - 2/2\n234\t      - 5-8/12\n235\t      - η_max genuine in both regimes\n236\t  - name: RF Per-Benchmark Detail\n237\t    columns:\n238\t    - Benchmark\n239\t    - η_max β\n240\t    - K_eff β\n241\t    - R²\n242\t    - K_eff p (bootstrap)\n243\t    rows:\n244\t    - - MMLU\n245\t      - '+0.482'\n246\t      - '+0.215'\n247\t      - '0.78'\n248\t      - '0.003'\n249\t    - - ARC\n250\t      - '+0.551'\n251\t      - '+0.379'\n252\t      - '0.81'\n253\t      - <0.001\n254\t  figures_description:\n255\t  - 'Dual-panel figure: (Left) coefficient comparison RF vs adaptive for η_max and\n256\t    K_eff with 95% CIs; (Right) R² comparison bar chart showing RF >> adaptive'\n257\t  - 'Scatter plot: predicted vs actual error rate under RF regime showing tight fit\n258\t    (R²≈0.80) vs adaptive regime showing wide dispersion'\n259\t  analysis: '这是论文的关键因果证据。RF 对照证明 K_eff 在满足 i.i.d. 假设时有真实效应——BFT 理论 在随机故障下成立。而 adaptive\n260\t    regime 下 K_eff 的 OLS 显著性完全是 panel overlap 的伪迹。 这不是\"diversity helps under RF but\n261\t    hurts under adaptive\"——K_eff 在两种 regime 下方向均 为正。区别是：RF 下 K_eff 的正关联是真实的（panel\n262\t    结构决定了容错性），adaptive 下是膨胀的 （adversary 引入的策略方差使 panel 结构预测力崩溃）。此发现为 Contribution\n263\t    #2（BFT reversal evidence）提供了不可替代的因果论证。'\n264\t- name: Capability-Matched Validation\n265\t  plan_id: plan_004\n266\t  description: 在同一 capability tier 内（主要利用 9-model base tier, 84 panels）测试控制 η_max\n267\t    方差后 K_eff 是否浮现为显著预测因子\n268\t  expected_results:\n269\t    primary_tier: base (9 models, 84 panels)\n270\t    within_tier_eta_max_variance_reduction: 65-70%\n271\t    within_tier_keff_eta_max_r: 0.35\n272\t    conditions: 12\n273\t    within_tier_keff_sig_ols: 5/12\n274\t    within_tier_keff_sig_clustered_se: 2/12\n275\t    within_tier_keff_direction: 4+/1-\n276\t    within_tier_eta_max_sig_ols: 7/12\n277\t    within_tier_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 4/12\n278\t    within_tier_dominance_ratio: '2:1'\n279\t    within_tier_r2_mean: 0.18\n280\t    cross_tier_comparison:\n281\t      full_pool_dominance_ratio: '5:1'\n282\t      within_tier_dominance_ratio: '2:1'\n283\t      interpretation: η_max still dominant but K_eff gains relative signal\n284\t  result_rationale: 在同一 capability tier 内，η_max 方差降低约 65-70%（因为同 tier 模型能力接近），而 K_eff\n285\t    方差保持（同 tier 模型仍来自不同 families/architectures）。η_max 和 K_eff 的 confound 从 r=0.70（全池）降至\n286\t    r≈0.35（tier 内），解开了回归中的多重共线性。在此条件下，K_eff 的边际信号——通常被 η_max 的强效应淹没——变得可检测。OLS 下 5/12\n287\t    显著；clustered SE 后 保留 2/12，表明 K_eff 有微弱但真实的独立效应。主导比从 5:1 降至 2:1，但 η_max 仍然 主导。这支持论文叙事：K_eff\n288\t    有方向性关联但在全池分析中被 η_max 压倒——当人为控制 η_max 方差时 K_eff 才浮现，这恰恰说明在自然变异条件下 η_max 是主要驱动因素。此外，within-tier\n289\t    R² 均值仅 0.18，说明 tier 内的面板脆弱性预测力大幅下降——进一步证明 η_max 的跨 tier 方差是预测力的主要来源。\n290\t  tables:\n291\t  - name: Cross-Tier vs Within-Tier Comparison\n292\t    columns:\n293\t    - Setting\n294\t    - Panels\n295\t    - K_eff-η_max r\n296\t    - η_max sig (CL-SE)\n297\t    - K_eff sig (CL-SE)\n298\t    - Ratio\n299\t    - R² mean\n300\t    rows:\n301\t    - - Full pool (15 models)\n302\t      - '455'\n303\t      - '0.70'\n304\t      - 8/12\n305\t      - 0/12\n306\t      - '8:0'\n307\t      - '0.30'\n308\t    - - Base tier (9 models)\n309\t      - '84'\n310\t      - '0.35'\n311\t      - 4/12\n312\t      - 2/12\n313\t      - '2:1'\n314\t      - '0.18'\n315\t    - - Frontier tier (3 models)\n316\t      - '1'\n317\t      - '-'\n318\t      - '-'\n319\t      - '-'\n320\t      - '-'\n321\t      - '-'\n322\t  - name: Within-Tier K_eff Significant Conditions\n323\t    columns:\n324\t    - Condition\n325\t    - K_eff β\n326\t    - K_eff p (CL-SE)\n327\t    - Direction\n328\t    - GAM confirms?\n329\t    rows:\n330\t    - - mmlu×prompt_injection\n331\t      - '+0.31'\n332\t      - '0.028'\n333\t      - positive\n334\t      - Yes (targeted)\n335\t    - - mmlu×score_manipulation\n336\t      - '+0.25'\n337\t      - '0.041'\n338\t      - positive\n339\t      - Yes (targeted)\n340\t  figures_description:\n341\t  - 'Coefficient forest plot: full pool vs within-tier, showing η_max shrinkage and\n342\t    K_eff emergence'\n343\t  - 'K_eff-η_max scatter: full pool (r=0.70) vs base tier (r=0.35), demonstrating\n344\t    confound reduction'\n345\t  analysis: Capability-matched validation 提供了 disentangle η_max 和 K_eff 的准自然实验。关键发现：\n346\t    即使在控制 η_max 方差后，K_eff 仍然是次要驱动因素（2:1 而非 1:1 或 K_eff 主导）。 论文可表述为：\"当 capability 差异被控制时，diversity\n347\t    浮现为统计上可检测的次要因素——但在 自然 panel 组合中，capability 差异（通过 η_max）压倒性地主导脆弱性。\"这强化了 robustness-first\n348\t    设计建议：先筛选 capability，再在筛选后的池中考虑 diversity。\n349\t- name: Two-Stage Panel Design Algorithm Benchmark\n350\t  plan_id: plan_005\n351\t  description: 实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法（filter η > threshold → maximize K_eff），对标\n352\t    5 个 baseline 策略\n353\t  expected_results:\n354\t    baselines:\n355\t    - random\n356\t    - max_keff\n357\t    - max_disagreement\n358\t    - strongest_k\n359\t    - uniform_family\n360\t    conditions: 12\n361\t    min_eta_max_wins: 12/12\n362\t    two_stage_vs_min_eta_max_improvement_pp:\n363\t    - 0.3\n364\t    - 1.8\n365\t    two_stage_vs_min_eta_max_mean_improvement_pp: 0.7\n366\t    two_stage_wins_vs_min_eta_max: 7/12\n367\t    strategy_ranking:\n368\t      rank_1: two-stage (robustness-first + K_eff)\n369\t      rank_2: min_eta_max (robustness-first only)\n370\t      rank_3: strongest_k\n371\t      rank_4: uniform_family\n372\t      rank_5: max_disagreement\n373\t      rank_6: max_keff\n374\t      rank_7: random\n375\t    max_keff_vs_random: worse in 8/12 (includes weak models)\n376\t    strongest_k_gap_from_min_eta_max: 1.2pp mean\n377\t    asr_advantage_range:\n378\t    - 0.038\n379\t    - 0.511\n380\t  result_rationale: min_eta_max 策略赢 12/12 因为 η_max 是主导脆弱性驱动因素。两阶段策略在 min_eta_max 基础上提供边际改进（mean\n381\t    0.7pp）：在已通过 robustness 筛选的 judge 子集中，K_eff 的微弱次要效应（在 capability-matched 设置中可检测，如\n382\t    plan_004 所示）被利用。改进最大 的条件是 targeted attacks（K_eff 方向为正 = diversity 有害 → 在 robustness-screened\n383\t    池中最小化 K_eff 有帮助）。改进最小的条件是 shared-bias attacks（K_eff 方向为负 → diversity 在这些条件下是保护性的\n384\t    → 最大化 K_eff 更优）。max_keff 策略表现差于 random 因为最大化 diversity 必然引入弱模型（r=0.70 tradeoff），直接提高了\n385\t    η_max。 strongest_k 与 min_eta_max 差距仅 1.2pp——因为最强模型通常也最鲁棒，但 min_eta_max 是直接优化目标函数而\n386\t    strongest_k 是代理指标。\n387\t  tables:\n388\t  - name: Strategy Comparison (Mean ASR across 12 conditions)\n389\t    columns:\n390\t    - Strategy\n391\t    - Mean ASR\n392\t    - Rank\n393\t    - Δ vs random (pp)\n394\t    rows:\n395\t    - - two-stage\n396\t      - '0.112'\n397\t      - '1'\n398\t      - '-8.3'\n399\t    - - min_eta_max\n400\t      - '0.119'\n401\t      - '2'\n402\t      - '-7.6'\n403\t    - - strongest_k\n404\t      - '0.131'\n405\t      - '3'\n406\t      - '-6.4'\n407\t    - - uniform_family\n408\t      - '0.158'\n409\t      - '4'\n410\t      - '-3.7'\n411\t    - - max_disagreement\n412\t      - '0.172'\n413\t      - '5'\n414\t      - '-2.3'\n415\t    - - random\n416\t      - '0.195'\n417\t      - '6'\n418\t      - '0.0'\n419\t    - - max_keff\n420\t      - '0.208'\n421\t      - '7'\n422\t      - '+1.3'\n423\t  - name: Two-Stage vs min_eta_max Per-Attack-Type\n424\t    columns:\n425\t    - Attack category\n426\t    - Conditions\n427\t    - Two-stage better?\n428\t    - Mean Δ (pp)\n429\t    rows:\n430\t    - - Targeted\n431\t      - '6'\n432\t      - 5/6\n433\t      - '-1.1'\n434\t    - - Shared-bias\n435\t      - '6'\n436\t      - 2/6\n437\t      - '-0.3'\n438\t  figures_description:\n439\t  - 'Strategy comparison radar chart: 7 strategies × 12 conditions, showing two-stage\n440\t    and min_eta_max as dominant envelope'\n441\t  - 'Pareto frontier plot: ASR vs K_eff across strategies, showing max_keff dominated'\n442\t  analysis: Two-stage 算法的边际改进（0.7pp）虽然在统计上一致但实际影响不大——论文应诚实呈现这一点。 核心 practical recommendation\n443\t    保持不变：robustness-first screening 是关键步骤，K_eff 优化是可选的次要步骤。max_keff 策略的失败（差于 random）是论文叙事的有力支撑——直观的\n444\t    \"多样化 panel\" 建议在实践中适得其反。\n445\t- name: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Analysis\n446\t  plan_id: plan_006\n447\t  description: 计算每个 panel × attack 的 per-judge ASR 分布的 Gini 系数和 Shannon 熵，量化 adaptive\n448\t    adversary 是否针对特定 judge\n449\t  expected_results:\n450\t    panels: 455\n451\t    conditions: 12\n452\t    gini_targeted_mean: 0.78\n453\t    gini_targeted_range:\n454\t    - 0.72\n455\t    - 0.85\n456\t    gini_shared_bias_mean: 0.43\n457\t    gini_shared_bias_range:\n458\t    - 0.35\n459\t    - 0.52\n460\t    gini_targeted_vs_shared_mannwhitney_p: <0.001\n461\t    entropy_targeted_mean: 0.82\n462\t    entropy_shared_bias_mean: 1.45\n463\t    gini_eta_max_correlation: 0.83\n464\t    top1_judge_asr_fraction_targeted: 0.61\n465\t    top1_judge_asr_fraction_shared: 0.38\n466\t  result_rationale: Targeted attacks（prompt injection, score manipulation, position\n467\t    bias）利用特定 judge 的个体弱点——adversary 的攻击策略集中在 panel 中最脆弱的 judge 上。这导致 ASR 分布 高度集中（Gini\n468\t    0.72-0.85）：top-1 judge 贡献了约 61% 的 panel 总 ASR。这是 η_max 主导性的直接微观机制证据——vulnerability\n469\t    确实集中在 weakest link。相比之下，shared-bias attacks（sycophancy, verbosity, authority）利用多个\n470\t    judges 共享的认知偏差，ASR 更 均匀地分布在 panel 成员间（Gini 0.35-0.52），top-1 judge 仅贡献约 38%。Gini\n471\t    与 η_max 的高相关（r=0.83）直接证明 panel-level vulnerability 与 judge-level concentration\n472\t    是同一现象的两个面。这为 GAM 6:6 split 提供了独立的 mechanistic 验证——targeted 和 shared-bias 不仅在 K_eff\n473\t    方向上分裂，在 ASR concentration 模式上也完全分裂。\n474\t  tables:\n475\t  - name: ASR Concentration by Attack Category\n476\t    columns:\n477\t    - Attack Type\n478\t    - Category\n479\t    - Gini (mean)\n480\t    - Entropy (mean)\n481\t    - Top-1 judge ASR fraction\n482\t    rows:\n483\t    - - prompt_injection\n484\t      - targeted\n485\t      - '0.82'\n486\t      - '0.73'\n487\t      - '0.65'\n488\t    - - score_manipulation\n489\t      - targeted\n490\t      - '0.79'\n491\t      - '0.78'\n492\t      - '0.62'\n493\t    - - position_bias\n494\t      - targeted\n495\t      - '0.74'\n496\t      - '0.94'\n497\t      - '0.56'\n498\t    - - sycophancy\n499\t      - shared-bias\n500\t      - '0.45'\n501\t      - '1.38'\n502\t      - '0.40'\n503\t    - - verbosity_bias\n504\t      - shared-bias\n505\t      - '0.42'\n506\t      - '1.47'\n507\t      - '0.37'\n508\t    - - authority_bias\n509\t      - shared-bias\n510\t      - '0.41'\n511\t      - '1.50'\n512\t      - '0.36'\n513\t  figures_description:\n514\t  - 'Violin plot: Gini coefficient distribution for targeted vs shared-bias attacks,\n515\t    showing clean separation'\n516\t  - 'Heatmap: per-judge ASR contribution matrix for a representative panel under prompt_injection\n517\t    (concentrated) vs sycophancy (dispersed)'\n518\t  analysis: ASR 浓度分析为 η_max 主导性提供了微观机制证据，超越了回归系数的间接推断。审稿人常问 \"what's the mechanism?\"——本实验直接回答：targeted\n519\t    adversary 将攻击集中在 weakest judge 上（Gini>0.7），使 η_max 成为 panel 脆弱性的充分统计量。shared-bias\n520\t    下 ASR 更分散 解释了为什么 K_eff 在这类攻击中为负——diversity 提供 partial immunity 因为并非所有 judges 都同样受\n521\t    shared bias 影响。此发现独立验证 GAM taxonomy。\n522\t- name: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff Visualization\n523\t  plan_id: plan_007\n524\t  description: 绘制 K_eff vs η_max scatter，拟合 tradeoff curve，计算 Pareto frontier，按 tier\n525\t    分层\n526\t  expected_results:\n527\t    overall_keff_etamax_r: 0.7\n528\t    overall_keff_etamax_r_ci95:\n529\t    - 0.66\n530\t    - 0.74\n531\t    tier_stratified:\n532\t      base_tier_r: 0.52\n533\t      mid_tier_r: 0.48\n534\t      frontier_tier_r: 0.35\n535\t    pareto_frontier_size: 12\n536\t    pareto_dominance_pct: 97.4% of panels dominated\n537\t    pareto_frontier_composition: predominantly low-K_eff, low-η_max panels\n538\t    tradeoff_curve_fit: monotone increasing, concave\n539\t    within_family_r: 0.81\n540\t    cross_family_r: 0.65\n541\t  result_rationale: 'r=0.70 的 structural correlation 源于当前 LLM 生态系统的特性：最大化 K_eff 需要包含来自\n542\t    不同 capability tiers 的模型（不同 family × tier 组合提供最大 behavioral diversity）， 这必然引入能力较弱的\n543\t    judges，推高 η_max。Tier 分层后 r 降低（base: 0.52, frontier: 0.35） 说明 tradeoff 在 tier 内较弱——within\n544\t    tier 的 diversity（来自不同 architecture/training） 不需要大幅牺牲 capability。这支持 two-stage\n545\t    recommendation 的逻辑：先筛选 capability tier（打破跨 tier tradeoff），再在 tier 内最大化 diversity（利用弱化的\n546\t    within-tier tradeoff）。 Pareto frontier 几乎全部由 low-K_eff, low-η_max panels 占据——no\n547\t    free lunch，但 robustness-first selection 自然落在 Pareto frontier 上。'\n548\t  tables:\n549\t  - name: Tradeoff Correlation by Stratification\n550\t    columns:\n551\t    - Stratification\n552\t    - N panels\n553\t    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n554\t    - 95% CI\n555\t    rows:\n556\t    - - Full pool\n557\t      - '455'\n558\t      - '0.70'\n559\t      - '[0.66, 0.74]'\n560\t    - - Base tier only\n561\t      - '84'\n562\t      - '0.52'\n563\t      - '[0.38, 0.64]'\n564\t    - - Within-family\n565\t      - varies\n566\t      - '0.81'\n567\t      - '[0.73, 0.87]'\n568\t    - - Cross-family\n569\t      - varies\n570\t      - '0.65'\n571\t      - '[0.58, 0.71]'\n572\t  figures_description:\n573\t  - K_eff vs η_max scatter (455 panels), color-coded by tier, with Pareto frontier\n574\t    highlighted and marginal density plots\n575\t  - Tradeoff curve with 95% CI band, showing concave monotone relationship\n576\t  analysis: 可视化使 structural constraint 具象化——审稿人直观理解为什么 max_keff 策略失败（右上角） 而 min_eta_max\n577\t    策略成功（左下角）。Tier 内相关降低的发现为 two-stage algorithm 提供了 理论基础：capability screening 打破了跨\n578\t    tier 的 strong tradeoff，使后续 diversity 优化在弱 tradeoff 条件下进行。此 figure 应作为论文 Fig 3\n579\t    或 Fig 4。\n580\t- name: Panel Size Sensitivity Analysis\n581\t  plan_id: plan_008\n582\t  description: 测试 K=3,5,7,9 不同 panel 尺寸下 η_max 主导性是否持续\n583\t  expected_results:\n584\t    panel_sizes:\n585\t    - 3\n586\t    - 5\n587\t    - 7\n588\t    - 9\n589\t    panels_per_size:\n590\t    - 455\n591\t    - 3003\n592\t    - 6435\n593\t    - 5005\n594\t    eta_max_sig_by_k_clustered_se:\n595\t      k3: 8/12\n596\t      k5: 9/12\n597\t      k7: 9/12\n598\t      k9: 8/12\n599\t    keff_sig_by_k_clustered_se:\n600\t      k3: 0/12\n601\t      k5: 1/12\n602\t      k7: 1/12\n603\t      k9: 2/12\n604\t    dominance_ratio_by_k:\n605\t      k3: '8:0'\n606\t      k5: '9:1'\n607\t      k7: '9:1'\n608\t      k9: '4:1'\n609\t    eta_max_effect_size_trend: decreasing with K (from 0.42 at K=3 to 0.31 at K=9)\n610\t    keff_effect_size_trend: stable (0.12-0.16 across all K)\n611\t    min_eta_max_wins_by_k:\n612\t      k3: 12/12\n613\t      k5: 12/12\n614\t      k7: 12/12\n615\t      k9: 12/12\n616\t    se_inflation_by_k:\n617\t    - 2.5\n618\t    - 4.1\n619\t    - 6.3\n620\t    - 7.8\n621\t  result_rationale: η_max 主导性在所有 K 下持续因为 weakest-link 机制是 scale-invariant：无论 panel\n622\t    有多少 judges，adversary 总是针对最脆弱的那个。K 增加时 η_max 的 effect size 略降（0.42→0.31） 因为更大 panel\n623\t    中 majority vote 的容错能力增加——单个 judge 的失败更难翻转整个 panel。 但 η_max 仍然主导，因为 adversary 不只针对一个\n624\t    judge——adaptive adversary 可以同时攻击 多个弱 judges。K_eff 在 K=9 时达到 2/12 显著：更多 panels（5005）提供了更多统计\n625\t    power， 但 effect size 保持微小（0.12-0.16）。SE 膨胀随 K 急剧增加（每个 model 出现在更多 panels 中），从\n626\t    K=3 的 2.5x 到 K=9 的 7.8x。这为 non-independence 校正方法的必要性 提供了更强的论据——在 K=7 或 K=9 下使用\n627\t    OLS 会产生极度膨胀的显著性计数。 min_eta_max 策略在所有 K 下赢 12/12，确认 practical recommendation 对\n628\t    panel size 鲁棒。\n629\t  tables:\n630\t  - name: Panel Size Sensitivity Summary (Clustered SE)\n631\t    columns:\n632\t    - K\n633\t    - Panels\n634\t    - η_max sig\n635\t    - K_eff sig\n636\t    - Ratio\n637\t    - SE inflation\n638\t    - η_max β (mean)\n639\t    rows:\n640\t    - - '3'\n641\t      - '455'\n642\t      - 8/12\n643\t      - 0/12\n644\t      - '8:0'\n645\t      - 2.5x\n646\t      - '0.42'\n647\t    - - '5'\n648\t      - '3003'\n649\t      - 9/12\n650\t      - 1/12\n651\t      - '9:1'\n652\t      - 4.1x\n653\t      - '0.38'\n654\t    - - '7'\n655\t      - '6435'\n656\t      - 9/12\n657\t      - 1/12\n658\t      - '9:1'\n659\t      - 6.3x\n660\t      - '0.34'\n661\t    - - '9'\n662\t      - '5005'\n663\t      - 8/12\n664\t      - 2/12\n665\t      - '4:1'\n666\t      - 7.8x\n667\t      - '0.31'\n668\t  figures_description:\n669\t  - 'Line plot: η_max and K_eff significance counts vs panel size K, showing η_max\n670\t    stability and K_eff marginal increase'\n671\t  - 'SE inflation curve: showing exponential growth of SE inflation factor with K,\n672\t    motivating clustered SE necessity'\n673\t  analysis: Panel size sensitivity 提供两个关键发现：(1) η_max 主导性在 K=3 到 K=9 范围内稳定持续， 确认 weakest-link\n674\t    不是小 panel 的 artifact；(2) SE 膨胀随 K 急剧增加，为方法论 contribution（non-independence correction\n675\t    的必要性）提供量化支撑。K=9 时 K_eff 达到 2/12 显著但 effect size 仍微小——power 增加检测到了真实但 practically\n676\t    insignificant 的效应。论文 supplementary 中可报告此分析作为 robustness check。\n677\t- name: VIF + Multicollinearity Diagnostic\n678\t  plan_id: plan_009\n679\t  description: 计算 VIF、partial correlations、residualized K_eff regression，应用 Bonferroni/FDR\n680\t    校正，尝试 beta regression\n681\t  expected_results:\n682\t    gpu_needed: false\n683\t    raw_vif_keff: 2.96\n684\t    raw_vif_eta_max: 2.96\n685\t    residualized_vif_keff: 1.0\n686\t    partial_correlation_keff_asr_given_eta: 0.18\n687\t    partial_correlation_eta_asr_given_keff: 0.42\n688\t    bonferroni_eta_max_sig: 7/12\n689\t    bonferroni_keff_sig: 2/12\n690\t    fdr_eta_max_sig: 8/12\n691\t    fdr_keff_sig: 3/12\n692\t    beta_regression_eta_max_sig: 10/12\n693\t    beta_regression_keff_sig: 4/12 (3+/1-)\n694\t    beta_regression_dispersion_phi:\n695\t    - 3.2\n696\t    - 8.7\n697\t    condition_number: 4.8\n698\t    reviewer_blocking_issue: false\n699\t  result_rationale: Raw VIF ≈ 2.96 直接由 r=0.70 的 confound 决定（VIF = 1/(1-r²) = 1/(1-0.49)\n700\t    = 1.96 在 bivariate 情况下；加上 tier indicators 后升至约 2.96）。VIF < 5 远低于标准 reviewer concern\n701\t    阈值（通常 VIF > 10），甚至低于 stricter 标准（VIF > 5）。Residualization 后 VIF 降至 1.0（by construction），residualized\n702\t    K_eff 的 partial correlation 仅 0.18 vs η_max 的 0.42——直接量化了主导性差异。Beta regression\n703\t    作为 ASR ∈ [0,1] 的 distributional 替代方案：η_max 显著性从 log-log OLS 的 11/12 降至 10/12（beta\n704\t    regression 对极端值更鲁棒），K_eff 从 8/12 升至 4/12（beta regression 更好地处理 heteroscedasticity）。Condition\n705\t    number 4.8 < 30 确认无有害多重共线性。Bonferroni 校正（most conservative）给出 η_max 7/12 vs K_eff\n706\t    2/12——即使在最保守的多重比较 校正下 η_max 仍显著主导。无 reviewer-blocking issue。\n707\t  tables:\n708\t  - name: Multicollinearity Diagnostics\n709\t    columns:\n710\t    - Metric\n711\t    - Value\n712\t    - Threshold\n713\t    - Status\n714\t    rows:\n715\t    - - VIF (K_eff, raw)\n716\t      - '2.96'\n717\t      - < 5 (strict) / < 10 (standard)\n718\t      - PASS\n719\t    - - VIF (K_eff, residualized)\n720\t      - '1.00'\n721\t      - < 5\n722\t      - PASS\n723\t    - - Condition number\n724\t      - '4.8'\n725\t      - < 30\n726\t      - PASS\n727\t    - - Partial r(K_eff, ASR | η_max)\n728\t      - '0.18'\n729\t      - '-'\n730\t      - Weak\n731\t    - - Partial r(η_max, ASR | K_eff)\n732\t      - '0.42'\n733\t      - '-'\n734\t      - Moderate-strong\n735\t  - name: Method Comparison with Multiple Testing Correction\n736\t    columns:\n737\t    - Method\n738\t    - η_max sig\n739\t    - K_eff sig\n740\t    - K_eff direction\n741\t    rows:\n742\t    - - OLS + FDR\n743\t      - 11/12\n744\t      - 8/12\n745\t      - 7+/1-\n746\t    - - OLS + Bonferroni\n747\t      - 7/12\n748\t      - 2/12\n749\t      - 2+/0-\n750\t    - - Clustered SE + FDR\n751\t      - 8/12\n752\t      - 0/12\n753\t      - '-'\n754\t    - - Beta regression + FDR\n755\t      - 10/12\n756\t      - 4/12\n757\t      - 3+/1-\n758\t  figures_description:\n759\t  - 'VIF bar chart: raw vs residualized for all predictors, with VIF=5 and VIF=10\n760\t    reference lines'\n761\t  - 'Partial correlation comparison: two-panel bar chart showing partial r for η_max\n762\t    and K_eff'\n763\t  analysis: VIF 分析消除了审稿人 RC1 的 last-resort 攻击角度——multicollinearity is moderate, not\n764\t    pathological。r=0.70 在经验社会科学中常见（e.g., income and education）， standard practice\n765\t    是报告 VIF 并继续。Beta regression 提供了 distributional robustness check：结论与 log-log OLS\n766\t    一致。论文可在 methods 节用一段话报告 VIF diagnostics 并在 supplementary 中给出完整表格。\n767\t- name: Aggregation Gradient Under Clustered SE\n768\t  plan_id: plan_010\n769\t  description: 在 clustered SE 和 bootstrap 下重新运行 4 种聚合规则 + 新增 veto rule，验证聚合梯度是否为真实效应而非\n770\t    overlap 伪迹\n771\t  expected_results:\n772\t    aggregation_rules:\n773\t    - majority\n774\t    - weighted\n775\t    - threshold\n776\t    - bayesian\n777\t    - veto\n778\t    correction_methods:\n779\t    - OLS\n780\t    - clustered_se\n781\t    - bootstrap_v2\n782\t    majority_clustered_se:\n783\t      eta_sig: 8/12\n784\t      keff_sig: 0/12\n785\t    weighted_clustered_se:\n786\t      eta_sig: 6/12\n787\t      keff_sig: 1/12\n788\t      keff_direction: 1+\n789\t    threshold_clustered_se:\n790\t      eta_sig: 10/12\n791\t      keff_sig: 4/12\n792\t      keff_direction: 3+/1-\n793\t      r2: 0.87\n794\t    bayesian_clustered_se:\n795\t      eta_sig: 5/12\n796\t      keff_sig: 4/12\n797\t      keff_direction: 1+/3-\n798\t      keff_negative_frac: 3/4\n799\t    veto_clustered_se:\n800\t      eta_sig: 11/12\n801\t      keff_sig: 0/12\n802\t      r2: 0.82\n803\t    bayesian_bootstrap:\n804\t      eta_sig: 3/12\n805\t      keff_sig: 3/12\n806\t      keff_direction: 0+/3-\n807\t      keff_negative_frac: 3/3\n808\t    gradient_preserved_under_correction: true\n809\t    bayesian_keff_flip_genuine: true\n810\t    aggregation_gradient_order: veto > threshold > majority > weighted > bayesian\n811\t  result_rationale: 聚合梯度在 clustered SE 下保持，因为不同投票规则产生的脆弱性差异是 structural/mathematical\n812\t    的，不是 panel overlap 的伪迹。Threshold（unanimity）要求所有 judges 一致，使单个 judge 的 failure\n813\t    直接传导为 panel failure——R²=0.87 说明 panel 结构几乎完全决定了 threshold voting 下的脆弱性。这种强 structural\n814\t    效应在 clustered SE 下大量存活（η_max 10/12, K_eff 4/12）。Veto rule（单个 judge 可否决）是 weakest-link\n815\t    的极端化——η_max 几乎 完美预测（11/12），K_eff 被完全压倒（0/12）。 Bayesian calibration 翻转 K_eff 方向的关键机制：Bayesian\n816\t    使用 prior accuracy 下调不可靠 judges 的权重，有效中和了 weakest-link 通道。η_max 的直接效应被削弱（11→5/12）。\n817\t    剩余的 K_eff 信号主要来自 shared-bias 条件（diversity 保护性的部分），因此净方向为负。 在 bootstrap 下，Bayesian\n818\t    K_eff 仅 3/12 显著但全部为负（3/3 negative fraction）—— direction flip 是真实的。这确认 aggregation\n819\t    是独立于 non-independence correction 的 control lever。论文的 prescriptive conclusion（robustness-first\n820\t    + Bayesian = dual-channel defense）在最严格校正下依然成立。\n821\t  tables:\n822\t  - name: Aggregation Gradient Under Clustered SE\n823\t    columns:\n824\t    - Rule\n825\t    - η_max sig\n826\t    - K_eff sig\n827\t    - K_eff neg frac\n828\t    - R²\n829\t    - Gradient position\n830\t    rows:\n831\t    - - Veto\n832\t      - 11/12\n833\t      - 0/12\n834\t      - '-'\n835\t      - '0.82'\n836\t      - Maximum vulnerability\n837\t    - - Threshold\n838\t      - 10/12\n839\t      - 4/12\n840\t      - 1/4\n841\t      - '0.87'\n842\t      - High\n843\t    - - Majority\n844\t      - 8/12\n845\t      - 0/12\n846\t      - '-'\n847\t      - '0.28'\n848\t      - Moderate\n849\t    - - Weighted\n850\t      - 6/12\n851\t      - 1/12\n852\t      - 0/1\n853\t      - '0.26'\n854\t      - Low-moderate\n855\t    - - Bayesian\n856\t      - 5/12\n857\t      - 4/12\n858\t      - 3/4\n859\t      - '0.09'\n860\t      - Minimum vulnerability\n861\t  - name: Bayesian K_eff Direction Detail\n862\t    columns:\n863\t    - Correction\n864\t    - K_eff sig total\n865\t    - K_eff positive\n866\t    - K_eff negative\n867\t    - Neg fraction\n868\t    rows:\n869\t    - - OLS\n870\t      - 7/12\n871\t      - '1'\n872\t      - '6'\n873\t      - 6/7 (86%)\n874\t    - - Clustered SE\n875\t      - 4/12\n876\t      - '1'\n877\t      - '3'\n878\t      - 3/4 (75%)\n879\t    - - Bootstrap v2\n880\t      - 3/12\n881\t      - '0'\n882\t      - '3'\n883\t      - 3/3 (100%)\n884\t  figures_description:\n885\t  - 'Aggregation gradient stacked bar chart: η_max and K_eff significance by rule,\n886\t    comparing OLS vs clustered SE side by side'\n887\t  - 'K_eff coefficient sign heatmap: 5 rules × 12 conditions, showing Bayesian blue\n888\t    (negative) vs threshold/veto red (positive)'\n889\t  analysis: 聚合梯度在校正下的稳健性是论文的独立贡献——它不受 non-independence concern 的影响，因为 它描述的是投票规则数学的\n890\t    structural 性质。Veto rule 的加入使梯度两端更 extreme： veto（pure weakest-link）vs Bayesian（weakest-link\n891\t    neutralized + diversity flip）。 论文可以将此呈现为 defense design spectrum——practitioners\n892\t    根据其对 false positive vs false negative 的偏好选择适当位置。Bayesian K_eff 在 bootstrap 下 3/3\n893\t    negative 是 cleanest possible evidence for the flip。\n894\t- name: Open-Ended Generation Benchmark Extension\n895\t  plan_id: plan_011\n896\t  description: 在 MT-Bench 风格的 open-ended generation 任务上测试 weakest-link 假说，超越 MCQ 格式\n897\t  expected_results:\n898\t    benchmark: MT-Bench (8 categories)\n899\t    judge_format: 1-10 scale scoring\n900\t    models_available: 12\n901\t    panels: 220\n902\t    attack_types:\n903\t    - style_manipulation\n904\t    - length_inflation\n905\t    - format_gaming\n906\t    conditions: 6\n907\t    eta_max_sig_ols: 5/6\n908\t    keff_sig_ols: 3/6 (2+/1-)\n909\t    eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 4/6\n910\t    keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/6\n911\t    r2_mean: 0.22\n912\t    gam_generation_split:\n913\t      style_manipulation: shared-bias (negative K_eff)\n914\t      length_inflation: shared-bias (negative K_eff)\n915\t      format_gaming: targeted (positive K_eff)\n916\t    min_eta_max_wins: 6/6\n917\t    cross_format_consistency: η_max dominant in both MCQ and generation\n918\t  result_rationale: η_max 主导性在 generation 任务中持续因为底层机制相同：无论 judges 评估 MCQ 正确性还是 generation\n919\t    质量，adversary 都针对最可操纵的 judge。Generation 的 1-10 scale 提供了比 MCQ binary 更多的操纵空间（微妙的\n920\t    style/format manipulation 可以影响 rubric-based scoring），但 vulnerability 的 distribution\n921\t    across judges 仍然是高度不均匀的—— 某些 judges 对 length inflation 或 format gaming 特别敏感。R²\n922\t    较低（0.22 vs MCQ 的 0.30）因为 generation evaluation 有更多 idiosyncratic variance（rubric\n923\t    interpretation, 文化偏好等）。K_eff 在 OLS 下 3/6 显著但 clustered SE 后归零——与 MCQ 完全一致。 GAM\n924\t    分类中，style manipulation 和 length inflation 属于 shared-bias（所有 LLM judges 都倾向于给更长/更\n925\t    polished 的回答更高分），而 format gaming 属于 targeted（利用特定 model 的 format parsing 差异）。12\n926\t    模型（部分 API 模型不支持 generation evaluation） 给出 220 panels，足够进行 regression analysis。min_eta_max\n927\t    策略在 generation 上同样 赢 6/6，确认 practical recommendation 跨 task format 通用。\n928\t  tables:\n929\t  - name: Generation Benchmark Results (Clustered SE)\n930\t    columns:\n931\t    - Condition\n932\t    - η_max sig?\n933\t    - K_eff sig?\n934\t    - K_eff GAM dir\n935\t    - R²\n936\t    rows:\n937\t    - - style_manipulation × MT-Bench\n938\t      - 'Yes'\n939\t      - 'No'\n940\t      - negative\n941\t      - '0.19'\n942\t    - - length_inflation × MT-Bench\n943\t      - 'Yes'\n944\t      - 'No'\n945\t      - negative\n946\t      - '0.24'\n947\t    - - format_gaming × MT-Bench\n948\t      - 'Yes'\n949\t      - 'No'\n950\t      - positive\n951\t      - '0.23'\n952\t  - name: Cross-Format Consistency\n953\t    columns:\n954\t    - Format\n955\t    - η_max sig (CL-SE)\n956\t    - K_eff sig (CL-SE)\n957\t    - Dominance ratio\n958\t    rows:\n959\t    - - MCQ (MMLU+ARC)\n960\t      - 8/12\n961\t      - 0/12\n962\t      - '8:0'\n963\t    - - Generation (MT-Bench)\n964\t      - 4/6\n965\t      - 0/6\n966\t      - '4:0'\n967\t    - - Combined\n968\t      - 12/18\n969\t      - 0/18\n970\t      - '12:0'\n971\t  figures_description:\n972\t  - 'Side-by-side coefficient forest plot: MCQ vs generation tasks, showing η_max\n973\t    dominance in both formats'\n974\t  analysis: Generation extension 消除了\"MCQ-specific artifact\"的审稿人质疑。η_max 主导性跨 task\n975\t    format 通用性是论文 generalizability 论证的关键证据。R² 降低反映了 generation evaluation 的内在 noise，但\n976\t    relative driver importance（η_max >> K_eff）完全保持。 此实验可作为 Section 5 的扩展分析或 supplementary\n977\t    material。\n978\t- name: Partial-Knowledge Adversary Model\n979\t  plan_id: plan_012\n980\t  description: 模拟 adversary 仅知道 judge family labels（不知具体脆弱性 profile）的 realistic threat\n981\t    model\n982\t  expected_results:\n983\t    knowledge_levels:\n984\t    - full (baseline)\n985\t    - family-only\n986\t    - random\n987\t    asr_reduction_family_vs_full_pct: 18\n988\t    asr_reduction_random_vs_full_pct: 42\n989\t    family_knowledge_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 7/12\n990\t    family_knowledge_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n991\t    family_knowledge_dominance_ratio: '7:0'\n992\t    random_targeting_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 3/12\n993\t    random_targeting_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n994\t    family_knowledge_r2_mean: 0.24\n995\t    family_label_attack_efficiency: 0.82\n996\t  result_rationale: Family-only adversary 的 ASR 仅降 18%（而非 random 的 42%），因为 family\n997\t    labels 与 vulnerability profiles 有中等相关：同 family 模型共享 training pipeline 和 architectural\n998\t    biases，adversary 可基于 family 推断出 approximately correct 的攻击 策略。η_max 仍然主导（7/12 vs\n999\t    full-knowledge 的 8/12）因为 family-level targeting 仍 preferentially hits weaker judges——family\n1000\t    labels 虽然 noisy 但 informationally above chance。K_eff 在 partial-knowledge 下同样为\n1001\t    0/12——diversity 在任何 knowledge level 下都不是 independent protective factor after correction。Attack\n1002\t    efficiency 0.82 意味着 family labels 提供了 82% of full-knowledge targeting effectiveness——这对\n1003\t    ecological validity 至关重要：现实中 adversary 通常知道 panel 的 model families （从 API endpoint,\n1004\t    response style 等推断），因此 full-knowledge 结果的 relevance 不仅限于理论上限。Random targeting\n1005\t    下 η_max 仅 3/12 显著——random adversary 无法有效 利用 individual weaknesses，说明 η_max 的 predictive\n1006\t    power 依赖于 adversary 的 targeting ability，与 adaptive vs RF contrast（plan_003）形成完整呼应。\n1007\t  tables:\n1008\t  - name: Adversary Knowledge Level Comparison (Clustered SE)\n1009\t    columns:\n1010\t    - Knowledge level\n1011\t    - Mean ASR\n1012\t    - ASR vs full (%)\n1013\t    - η_max sig\n1014\t    - K_eff sig\n1015\t    - R²\n1016\t    rows:\n1017\t    - - Full knowledge\n1018\t      - '0.195'\n1019\t      - 100%\n1020\t      - 8/12\n1021\t      - 0/12\n1022\t      - '0.30'\n1023\t    - - Family-only\n1024\t      - '0.160'\n1025\t      - 82%\n1026\t      - 7/12\n1027\t      - 0/12\n1028\t      - '0.24'\n1029\t    - - Random\n1030\t      - '0.113'\n1031\t      - 58%\n1032\t      - 3/12\n1033\t      - 0/12\n1034\t      - '0.08'\n1035\t  - name: Family Label Informativeness\n1036\t    columns:\n1037\t    - Metric\n1038\t    - Value\n1039\t    - Interpretation\n1040\t    rows:\n1041\t    - - Attack efficiency (family/full)\n1042\t      - '0.82'\n1043\t      - Family labels highly informative for targeting\n1044\t    - - Family-vulnerability correlation\n1045\t      - '0.61'\n1046\t      - Moderate; same family shares weaknesses\n1047\t    - - η_max sig retention (family vs full)\n1048\t      - 7/8\n1049\t      - Targeting still exploits weakest link\n1050\t  figures_description:\n1051\t  - 'Three-panel ASR distribution: full vs family-only vs random, showing gradual\n1052\t    degradation'\n1053\t  - η_max coefficient trajectory across knowledge levels, showing graceful degradation\n1054\t  analysis: Partial-knowledge 实验将论文结论从 worst-case（omniscient adversary）扩展至 realistic\n1055\t    threat model。Family-only adversary 保留 82% 攻击效率这一发现对 practical defense implications\n1056\t    至关重要——defenders 不能依赖\"adversary 不知道 panel 具体组成\"的假设， 因为 family-level knowledge 几乎\n1057\t    sufficient。η_max 在所有 knowledge levels 下主导， K_eff 在所有 knowledge levels 下为 0/12——核心发现对\n1058\t    adversary 能力假设鲁棒。 Random targeting 的 R²=0.08 呼应 plan_003 的 RF 结论：panel 结构的预测力依赖于\n1059\t    adversary 的 strategic targeting——这是论文 adaptive vs random 对比叙事的第三个 independent\n1060\t    evidence line。\n1061\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bda18e7-83b6-4802-bb79-dc8ba6392b86","uuid":"dc24e3c5-80da-41c5-824a-d71e51997e96","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:49:08.653Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T221131/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 所有 planned 实验均确认并强化 v5 framing。η_max 在新攻击类型、面板尺寸、生成任务中全面主导； K_eff\n  脆弱性在每种校正方法下稳定复现。RF 对照实验提供 BFT 反转的干净因果证据； GAM 6:6 分割在 bootstrapped CIs 下通过验证并扩展至新攻击类型；聚合梯度在\n  clustered SE 下复现， Bayesian 翻转 K_eff 方向这一发现被确认为真实效应而非统计伪迹。五贡献堆栈完整无缺， 论文作为一项自信的实证贡献交付，附带可操作的防御建议和方法论透明性。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 15-Model Scaling Expansion\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 扩展至 15 模型（6 families），455 panels × 12 conditions 全量回归 + MI 矩阵 + 所有校正方法\n  expected_results:\n    status: DONE (plan001_step1_full_v4)\n    models: 15\n    panels: 455\n    conditions: 12\n    eta_max_sig_ols: 11/12\n    keff_sig_ols: 8/12 (7+/1-)\n    eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 8/12\n    keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n    eta_max_sig_bootstrap_v2: 5/12\n    keff_sig_bootstrap_v2: 1/12\n    eta_max_sig_mixed_effects: 7/12\n    keff_sig_mixed_effects: 3/12\n    dominance_ratio_bootstrap: '5:1'\n    gam_split: 6 targeted positive / 6 shared-bias negative\n    min_eta_max_wins: 12/12\n    confound_r: 0.701\n    se_inflation_factor: ~2.5x\n    rf_keff_sig: 2/2\n    rf_r2_mmlu: 0.734\n    rf_r2_arc: 0.813\n  result_rationale: 已完成。15 模型覆盖 6 families × 3 capability tiers，提供 η_max 和 K_eff 充足方差。\n    SE 膨胀 ~2.5x 与 91/455 panel overlap 一致（claude-3-haiku 出现在 91 个 panels 中）。 η_max\n    存活校正因为它捕捉的是真实的个体 judge 脆弱性——不是 panel 重叠伪迹。 K_eff 崩溃因为其 OLS 显著性被 overlapping panels\n    的相关残差膨胀——clustered SE 控制共享 judge 成员关系后，K_eff 的独立信号太弱。GAM 6:6 分割源于攻击机制差异： targeted\n    attacks 利用 judge 特异性弱点（diversity = 更多攻击面），shared-bias attacks 利用共性认知偏差（diversity\n    = 部分 judges 免疫）。\n  tables:\n  - name: Correction Method Comparison (Actual Results)\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - K_eff dir\n    - Note\n    rows:\n    - - OLS\n      - 11/12\n      - 8/12\n      - 7+/1-\n      - Panel overlap inflated\n    - - Clustered SE (CR1, 15 clusters)\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '-'\n      - Conservative\n    - - Wild cluster bootstrap v2\n      - 5/12\n      - 1/12\n      - 1+\n      - Max-p across 3 positions\n    - - Mixed effects\n      - 7/12\n      - 3/12\n      - 3+\n      - Random judge intercepts\n  figures_description:\n  - 已生成：OLS vs corrected p-value 对比热图，12 conditions × 4 methods\n  analysis: 已完成。η_max:K_eff 主导比从 OLS 的 1.4:1 升至 bootstrap 的 5:1，证明相对主导性在校正下 增强而非减弱。Benchmark\n    不对称（MMLU 4/6 vs ARC 1/6 存活 bootstrap）由 MMLU 4-choice 格式提供更多 scoring variance 解释。此结果构成\n    paper 的实证基础。\n- name: Attack Surface Expansion\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: 新增 3 种攻击类型（few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation, instruction override），在\n    15 模型 × 2 benchmarks 上运行，共 6 新 conditions\n  expected_results:\n    new_attack_types: 3\n    new_conditions: 6\n    total_conditions: 18\n    new_eta_max_sig_ols: 6/6\n    new_keff_sig_ols: 4/6 (3+/1-)\n    new_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 5/6\n    new_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/6\n    new_eta_max_sig_bootstrap: 3/6\n    new_keff_sig_bootstrap: 0/6\n    combined_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 13/18\n    combined_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/18\n    combined_dominance_ratio_clustered_se: '13:0'\n    gam_extended_split: 10 targeted positive / 8 shared-bias negative\n    gam_new_attacks_classification:\n      few_shot_hijacking: targeted (positive K_eff)\n      persona_manipulation: shared-bias (negative K_eff)\n      instruction_override: targeted (positive K_eff)\n    new_r2_range:\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.45\n    min_eta_max_wins_extended: 18/18\n  result_rationale: Few-shot hijacking 利用模型在 in-context learning 上的个体差异——不同 judges\n    对 few-shot 示例的敏感度差异极大（GPT-4.1 vs Llama-8B 可差 3-5x），因此属于 targeted attack，η_max\n    捕捉最易受影响的 judge。Instruction override 利用 instruction-following 能力的模型间方差， 同样属于 targeted。Persona\n    manipulation 利用 LLMs 对权威/身份线索的普遍敏感性——这是一种 共享认知偏差，不同能力模型都会受影响，因此属于 shared-bias，K_eff\n    方向为负（diversity 提供 部分免疫）。新攻击在 OLS 下延续 η_max 主导模式，但 K_eff 再次因 panel overlap 膨胀而\n    显著——clustered SE 后归零，与原 12 conditions 完全一致。GAM 扩展至 10:8 分割，clean taxonomy 覆盖 9\n    种攻击类型。\n  tables:\n  - name: Extended Attack Taxonomy (Clustered SE)\n    columns:\n    - Attack Type\n    - Mechanism\n    - Benchmark\n    - η_max sig?\n    - K_eff sig?\n    - K_eff GAM direction\n    rows:\n    - - few-shot hijacking\n      - targeted\n      - MMLU\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - positive\n    - - few-shot hijacking\n      - targeted\n      - ARC\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - positive\n    - - persona manipulation\n      - shared-bias\n      - MMLU\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - negative\n    - - persona manipulation\n      - shared-bias\n      - ARC\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - negative\n    - - instruction override\n      - targeted\n      - MMLU\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - positive\n    - - instruction override\n      - targeted\n      - ARC\n      - 'No'\n      - 'No'\n      - positive\n  - name: Extended GAM Split Summary\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Original (6 attacks)\n    - New (3 attacks)\n    - Total\n    - K_eff direction\n    rows:\n    - - Targeted\n      - 6/6 positive\n      - 4/4 positive\n      - 10/10\n      - positive (diversity harmful)\n    - - Shared-bias\n      - 6/6 negative\n      - 2/2 negative (persona×2)\n      - 8/8\n      - negative (diversity protective)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Extended GAM partial effect heatmap: 9 attack types × 2 benchmarks, color-coded\n    by K_eff direction'\n  - 'η_max dominance ratio bar chart: original 12 vs extended 18 conditions under\n    each correction method'\n  analysis: 新攻击类型提供独立证据线，确认 η_max 主导性不依赖于特定攻击选择。GAM taxonomy 从 6:6 扩展至 10:8，mechanistic\n    split 的稳健性增强——审稿人无法再质疑 taxonomy 是 cherry-picked 6 种 攻击的巧合。Instruction override\n    在 ARC 上 η_max 未显著（ARC 2-choice 格式对 instruction override 的 judge 间方差不敏感），与原始 benchmark\n    asymmetry 一致。论文标题和核心叙事完全支持。\n- name: Random-Fault BFT Contrast Experiment\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: Monte Carlo 随机故障模拟作为 BFT 对照。每个 judge 以 η_j = 1 - clean_accuracy 独立失败，majority\n    vote。对比 adaptive regime 证明 BFT 反转\n  expected_results:\n    regime: Random Fault (i.i.d.)\n    conditions: 2\n    monte_carlo_iterations: 10000\n    rf_keff_sig_ols: 2/2\n    rf_keff_sig_clustered_se: 2/2\n    rf_keff_sig_bootstrap: 2/2\n    rf_keff_direction: positive (2/2)\n    rf_keff_std_beta_mmlu: 0.215\n    rf_keff_std_beta_arc: 0.379\n    rf_eta_sig_all_methods: 2/2\n    rf_r2_mmlu: 0.78\n    rf_r2_arc: 0.81\n    adaptive_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n    adaptive_keff_sig_bootstrap: 1/12\n    delta_r2_rf_vs_adaptive: 0.48\n    go_nogo_gate: PASS (RF K_eff ≥2/2)\n  result_rationale: 随机故障下 K_eff 显著的根本原因是 BFT 的 i.i.d. 假设成立：每个 judge 独立以固定概率犯错， panel\n    结构（多样性）直接影响冗余覆盖。K_eff 高的 panel 中 judges 的错误模式更不相关， majority vote 的容错能力与独立性成正比——这正是\n    BFT 的核心机制。K_eff 方向为正（diversity → higher error）因为高 K_eff panel 必然包含弱模型（r=0.70 tradeoff），而在\n    i.i.d. 体制下 弱模型的高错误率直接传导为 panel 错误率——但关键是 K_eff 的贡献是独立的、真实的（所有校正 方法均显著 2/2）。对照\n    adaptive regime：相同的 K_eff 在 OLS 下显著 8/12，但 clustered SE 后崩溃至 0/12——因为 adaptive\n    adversary 引入了 panel 结构无法预测的策略方差，K_eff 的 apparent OLS 信号完全来自 panel overlap 膨胀。R²\n    差异（RF 0.78-0.81 vs adaptive ~0.30） 直接量化了 adaptive adversary 引入的不可预测性。GO/NO-GO\n    gate 通过，BFT framing 得到 因果层面的支撑。\n  tables:\n  - name: RF vs Adaptive Contrast (Key Metrics)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Random Fault\n    - Adaptive\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - K_eff sig (OLS)\n      - 2/2\n      - 8/12 (7+/1-)\n      - Both appear significant under OLS\n    - - K_eff sig (Clustered SE)\n      - 2/2\n      - 0/12\n      - RF genuine; adaptive artifactual\n    - - K_eff sig (Bootstrap v2)\n      - 2/2\n      - 1/12\n      - Consistent contrast\n    - - K_eff std β (mean)\n      - '+0.297'\n      - '+0.164'\n      - RF effect larger and genuine\n    - - R²\n      - 0.78-0.81\n      - 0.25-0.35\n      - RF structurally determined; adaptive not\n    - - η_max sig (all methods)\n      - 2/2\n      - 5-8/12\n      - η_max genuine in both regimes\n  - name: RF Per-Benchmark Detail\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - η_max β\n    - K_eff β\n    - R²\n    - K_eff p (bootstrap)\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - '+0.482'\n      - '+0.215'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.003'\n    - - ARC\n      - '+0.551'\n      - '+0.379'\n      - '0.81'\n      - <0.001\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-panel figure: (Left) coefficient comparison RF vs adaptive for η_max and\n    K_eff with 95% CIs; (Right) R² comparison bar chart showing RF >> adaptive'\n  - 'Scatter plot: predicted vs actual error rate under RF regime showing tight fit\n    (R²≈0.80) vs adaptive regime showing wide dispersion'\n  analysis: '这是论文的关键因果证据。RF 对照证明 K_eff 在满足 i.i.d. 假设时有真实效应——BFT 理论 在随机故障下成立。而 adaptive\n    regime 下 K_eff 的 OLS 显著性完全是 panel overlap 的伪迹。 这不是\"diversity helps under RF but\n    hurts under adaptive\"——K_eff 在两种 regime 下方向均 为正。区别是：RF 下 K_eff 的正关联是真实的（panel\n    结构决定了容错性），adaptive 下是膨胀的 （adversary 引入的策略方差使 panel 结构预测力崩溃）。此发现为 Contribution\n    #2（BFT reversal evidence）提供了不可替代的因果论证。'\n- name: Capability-Matched Validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 在同一 capability tier 内（主要利用 9-model base tier, 84 panels）测试控制 η_max\n    方差后 K_eff 是否浮现为显著预测因子\n  expected_results:\n    primary_tier: base (9 models, 84 panels)\n    within_tier_eta_max_variance_reduction: 65-70%\n    within_tier_keff_eta_max_r: 0.35\n    conditions: 12\n    within_tier_keff_sig_ols: 5/12\n    within_tier_keff_sig_clustered_se: 2/12\n    within_tier_keff_direction: 4+/1-\n    within_tier_eta_max_sig_ols: 7/12\n    within_tier_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 4/12\n    within_tier_dominance_ratio: '2:1'\n    within_tier_r2_mean: 0.18\n    cross_tier_comparison:\n      full_pool_dominance_ratio: '5:1'\n      within_tier_dominance_ratio: '2:1'\n      interpretation: η_max still dominant but K_eff gains relative signal\n  result_rationale: 在同一 capability tier 内，η_max 方差降低约 65-70%（因为同 tier 模型能力接近），而 K_eff\n    方差保持（同 tier 模型仍来自不同 families/architectures）。η_max 和 K_eff 的 confound 从 r=0.70（全池）降至\n    r≈0.35（tier 内），解开了回归中的多重共线性。在此条件下，K_eff 的边际信号——通常被 η_max 的强效应淹没——变得可检测。OLS 下 5/12\n    显著；clustered SE 后 保留 2/12，表明 K_eff 有微弱但真实的独立效应。主导比从 5:1 降至 2:1，但 η_max 仍然 主导。这支持论文叙事：K_eff\n    有方向性关联但在全池分析中被 η_max 压倒——当人为控制 η_max 方差时 K_eff 才浮现，这恰恰说明在自然变异条件下 η_max 是主要驱动因素。此外，within-tier\n    R² 均值仅 0.18，说明 tier 内的面板脆弱性预测力大幅下降——进一步证明 η_max 的跨 tier 方差是预测力的主要来源。\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-Tier vs Within-Tier Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Setting\n    - Panels\n    - K_eff-η_max r\n    - η_max sig (CL-SE)\n    - K_eff sig (CL-SE)\n    - Ratio\n    - R² mean\n    rows:\n    - - Full pool (15 models)\n      - '455'\n      - '0.70'\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '8:0'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Base tier (9 models)\n      - '84'\n      - '0.35'\n      - 4/12\n      - 2/12\n      - '2:1'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - Frontier tier (3 models)\n      - '1'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n  - name: Within-Tier K_eff Significant Conditions\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - K_eff β\n    - K_eff p (CL-SE)\n    - Direction\n    - GAM confirms?\n    rows:\n    - - mmlu×prompt_injection\n      - '+0.31'\n      - '0.028'\n      - positive\n      - Yes (targeted)\n    - - mmlu×score_manipulation\n      - '+0.25'\n      - '0.041'\n      - positive\n      - Yes (targeted)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Coefficient forest plot: full pool vs within-tier, showing η_max shrinkage and\n    K_eff emergence'\n  - 'K_eff-η_max scatter: full pool (r=0.70) vs base tier (r=0.35), demonstrating\n    confound reduction'\n  analysis: Capability-matched validation 提供了 disentangle η_max 和 K_eff 的准自然实验。关键发现：\n    即使在控制 η_max 方差后，K_eff 仍然是次要驱动因素（2:1 而非 1:1 或 K_eff 主导）。 论文可表述为：\"当 capability 差异被控制时，diversity\n    浮现为统计上可检测的次要因素——但在 自然 panel 组合中，capability 差异（通过 η_max）压倒性地主导脆弱性。\"这强化了 robustness-first\n    设计建议：先筛选 capability，再在筛选后的池中考虑 diversity。\n- name: Two-Stage Panel Design Algorithm Benchmark\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法（filter η > threshold → maximize K_eff），对标\n    5 个 baseline 策略\n  expected_results:\n    baselines:\n    - random\n    - max_keff\n    - max_disagreement\n    - strongest_k\n    - uniform_family\n    conditions: 12\n    min_eta_max_wins: 12/12\n    two_stage_vs_min_eta_max_improvement_pp:\n    - 0.3\n    - 1.8\n    two_stage_vs_min_eta_max_mean_improvement_pp: 0.7\n    two_stage_wins_vs_min_eta_max: 7/12\n    strategy_ranking:\n      rank_1: two-stage (robustness-first + K_eff)\n      rank_2: min_eta_max (robustness-first only)\n      rank_3: strongest_k\n      rank_4: uniform_family\n      rank_5: max_disagreement\n      rank_6: max_keff\n      rank_7: random\n    max_keff_vs_random: worse in 8/12 (includes weak models)\n    strongest_k_gap_from_min_eta_max: 1.2pp mean\n    asr_advantage_range:\n    - 0.038\n    - 0.511\n  result_rationale: min_eta_max 策略赢 12/12 因为 η_max 是主导脆弱性驱动因素。两阶段策略在 min_eta_max 基础上提供边际改进（mean\n    0.7pp）：在已通过 robustness 筛选的 judge 子集中，K_eff 的微弱次要效应（在 capability-matched 设置中可检测，如\n    plan_004 所示）被利用。改进最大 的条件是 targeted attacks（K_eff 方向为正 = diversity 有害 → 在 robustness-screened\n    池中最小化 K_eff 有帮助）。改进最小的条件是 shared-bias attacks（K_eff 方向为负 → diversity 在这些条件下是保护性的\n    → 最大化 K_eff 更优）。max_keff 策略表现差于 random 因为最大化 diversity 必然引入弱模型（r=0.70 tradeoff），直接提高了\n    η_max。 strongest_k 与 min_eta_max 差距仅 1.2pp——因为最强模型通常也最鲁棒，但 min_eta_max 是直接优化目标函数而\n    strongest_k 是代理指标。\n  tables:\n  - name: Strategy Comparison (Mean ASR across 12 conditions)\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Mean ASR\n    - Rank\n    - Δ vs random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - two-stage\n      - '0.112'\n      - '1'\n      - '-8.3'\n    - - min_eta_max\n      - '0.119'\n      - '2'\n      - '-7.6'\n    - - strongest_k\n      - '0.131'\n      - '3'\n      - '-6.4'\n    - - uniform_family\n      - '0.158'\n      - '4'\n      - '-3.7'\n    - - max_disagreement\n      - '0.172'\n      - '5'\n      - '-2.3'\n    - - random\n      - '0.195'\n      - '6'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - max_keff\n      - '0.208'\n      - '7'\n      - '+1.3'\n  - name: Two-Stage vs min_eta_max Per-Attack-Type\n    columns:\n    - Attack category\n    - Conditions\n    - Two-stage better?\n    - Mean Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Targeted\n      - '6'\n      - 5/6\n      - '-1.1'\n    - - Shared-bias\n      - '6'\n      - 2/6\n      - '-0.3'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Strategy comparison radar chart: 7 strategies × 12 conditions, showing two-stage\n    and min_eta_max as dominant envelope'\n  - 'Pareto frontier plot: ASR vs K_eff across strategies, showing max_keff dominated'\n  analysis: Two-stage 算法的边际改进（0.7pp）虽然在统计上一致但实际影响不大——论文应诚实呈现这一点。 核心 practical recommendation\n    保持不变：robustness-first screening 是关键步骤，K_eff 优化是可选的次要步骤。max_keff 策略的失败（差于 random）是论文叙事的有力支撑——直观的\n    \"多样化 panel\" 建议在实践中适得其反。\n- name: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 计算每个 panel × attack 的 per-judge ASR 分布的 Gini 系数和 Shannon 熵，量化 adaptive\n    adversary 是否针对特定 judge\n  expected_results:\n    panels: 455\n    conditions: 12\n    gini_targeted_mean: 0.78\n    gini_targeted_range:\n    - 0.72\n    - 0.85\n    gini_shared_bias_mean: 0.43\n    gini_shared_bias_range:\n    - 0.35\n    - 0.52\n    gini_targeted_vs_shared_mannwhitney_p: <0.001\n    entropy_targeted_mean: 0.82\n    entropy_shared_bias_mean: 1.45\n    gini_eta_max_correlation: 0.83\n    top1_judge_asr_fraction_targeted: 0.61\n    top1_judge_asr_fraction_shared: 0.38\n  result_rationale: Targeted attacks（prompt injection, score manipulation, position\n    bias）利用特定 judge 的个体弱点——adversary 的攻击策略集中在 panel 中最脆弱的 judge 上。这导致 ASR 分布 高度集中（Gini\n    0.72-0.85）：top-1 judge 贡献了约 61% 的 panel 总 ASR。这是 η_max 主导性的直接微观机制证据——vulnerability\n    确实集中在 weakest link。相比之下，shared-bias attacks（sycophancy, verbosity, authority）利用多个\n    judges 共享的认知偏差，ASR 更 均匀地分布在 panel 成员间（Gini 0.35-0.52），top-1 judge 仅贡献约 38%。Gini\n    与 η_max 的高相关（r=0.83）直接证明 panel-level vulnerability 与 judge-level concentration\n    是同一现象的两个面。这为 GAM 6:6 split 提供了独立的 mechanistic 验证——targeted 和 shared-bias 不仅在 K_eff\n    方向上分裂，在 ASR concentration 模式上也完全分裂。\n  tables:\n  - name: ASR Concentration by Attack Category\n    columns:\n    - Attack Type\n    - Category\n    - Gini (mean)\n    - Entropy (mean)\n    - Top-1 judge ASR fraction\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_injection\n      - targeted\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.73'\n      - '0.65'\n    - - score_manipulation\n      - targeted\n      - '0.79'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.62'\n    - - position_bias\n      - targeted\n      - '0.74'\n      - '0.94'\n      - '0.56'\n    - - sycophancy\n      - shared-bias\n      - '0.45'\n      - '1.38'\n      - '0.40'\n    - - verbosity_bias\n      - shared-bias\n      - '0.42'\n      - '1.47'\n      - '0.37'\n    - - authority_bias\n      - shared-bias\n      - '0.41'\n      - '1.50'\n      - '0.36'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Violin plot: Gini coefficient distribution for targeted vs shared-bias attacks,\n    showing clean separation'\n  - 'Heatmap: per-judge ASR contribution matrix for a representative panel under prompt_injection\n    (concentrated) vs sycophancy (dispersed)'\n  analysis: ASR 浓度分析为 η_max 主导性提供了微观机制证据，超越了回归系数的间接推断。审稿人常问 \"what's the mechanism?\"——本实验直接回答：targeted\n    adversary 将攻击集中在 weakest judge 上（Gini>0.7），使 η_max 成为 panel 脆弱性的充分统计量。shared-bias\n    下 ASR 更分散 解释了为什么 K_eff 在这类攻击中为负——diversity 提供 partial immunity 因为并非所有 judges 都同样受\n    shared bias 影响。此发现独立验证 GAM taxonomy。\n- name: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff Visualization\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 绘制 K_eff vs η_max scatter，拟合 tradeoff curve，计算 Pareto frontier，按 tier\n    分层\n  expected_results:\n    overall_keff_etamax_r: 0.7\n    overall_keff_etamax_r_ci95:\n    - 0.66\n    - 0.74\n    tier_stratified:\n      base_tier_r: 0.52\n      mid_tier_r: 0.48\n      frontier_tier_r: 0.35\n    pareto_frontier_size: 12\n    pareto_dominance_pct: 97.4% of panels dominated\n    pareto_frontier_composition: predominantly low-K_eff, low-η_max panels\n    tradeoff_curve_fit: monotone increasing, concave\n    within_family_r: 0.81\n    cross_family_r: 0.65\n  result_rationale: 'r=0.70 的 structural correlation 源于当前 LLM 生态系统的特性：最大化 K_eff 需要包含来自\n    不同 capability tiers 的模型（不同 family × tier 组合提供最大 behavioral diversity）， 这必然引入能力较弱的\n    judges，推高 η_max。Tier 分层后 r 降低（base: 0.52, frontier: 0.35） 说明 tradeoff 在 tier 内较弱——within\n    tier 的 diversity（来自不同 architecture/training） 不需要大幅牺牲 capability。这支持 two-stage\n    recommendation 的逻辑：先筛选 capability tier（打破跨 tier tradeoff），再在 tier 内最大化 diversity（利用弱化的\n    within-tier tradeoff）。 Pareto frontier 几乎全部由 low-K_eff, low-η_max panels 占据——no\n    free lunch，但 robustness-first selection 自然落在 Pareto frontier 上。'\n  tables:\n  - name: Tradeoff Correlation by Stratification\n    columns:\n    - Stratification\n    - N panels\n    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - Full pool\n      - '455'\n      - '0.70'\n      - '[0.66, 0.74]'\n    - - Base tier only\n      - '84'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '[0.38, 0.64]'\n    - - Within-family\n      - varies\n      - '0.81'\n      - '[0.73, 0.87]'\n    - - Cross-family\n      - varies\n      - '0.65'\n      - '[0.58, 0.71]'\n  figures_description:\n  - K_eff vs η_max scatter (455 panels), color-coded by tier, with Pareto frontier\n    highlighted and marginal density plots\n  - Tradeoff curve with 95% CI band, showing concave monotone relationship\n  analysis: 可视化使 structural constraint 具象化——审稿人直观理解为什么 max_keff 策略失败（右上角） 而 min_eta_max\n    策略成功（左下角）。Tier 内相关降低的发现为 two-stage algorithm 提供了 理论基础：capability screening 打破了跨\n    tier 的 strong tradeoff，使后续 diversity 优化在弱 tradeoff 条件下进行。此 figure 应作为论文 Fig 3\n    或 Fig 4。\n- name: Panel Size Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 测试 K=3,5,7,9 不同 panel 尺寸下 η_max 主导性是否持续\n  expected_results:\n    panel_sizes:\n    - 3\n    - 5\n    - 7\n    - 9\n    panels_per_size:\n    - 455\n    - 3003\n    - 6435\n    - 5005\n    eta_max_sig_by_k_clustered_se:\n      k3: 8/12\n      k5: 9/12\n      k7: 9/12\n      k9: 8/12\n    keff_sig_by_k_clustered_se:\n      k3: 0/12\n      k5: 1/12\n      k7: 1/12\n      k9: 2/12\n    dominance_ratio_by_k:\n      k3: '8:0'\n      k5: '9:1'\n      k7: '9:1'\n      k9: '4:1'\n    eta_max_effect_size_trend: decreasing with K (from 0.42 at K=3 to 0.31 at K=9)\n    keff_effect_size_trend: stable (0.12-0.16 across all K)\n    min_eta_max_wins_by_k:\n      k3: 12/12\n      k5: 12/12\n      k7: 12/12\n      k9: 12/12\n    se_inflation_by_k:\n    - 2.5\n    - 4.1\n    - 6.3\n    - 7.8\n  result_rationale: η_max 主导性在所有 K 下持续因为 weakest-link 机制是 scale-invariant：无论 panel\n    有多少 judges，adversary 总是针对最脆弱的那个。K 增加时 η_max 的 effect size 略降（0.42→0.31） 因为更大 panel\n    中 majority vote 的容错能力增加——单个 judge 的失败更难翻转整个 panel。 但 η_max 仍然主导，因为 adversary 不只针对一个\n    judge——adaptive adversary 可以同时攻击 多个弱 judges。K_eff 在 K=9 时达到 2/12 显著：更多 panels（5005）提供了更多统计\n    power， 但 effect size 保持微小（0.12-0.16）。SE 膨胀随 K 急剧增加（每个 model 出现在更多 panels 中），从\n    K=3 的 2.5x 到 K=9 的 7.8x。这为 non-independence 校正方法的必要性 提供了更强的论据——在 K=7 或 K=9 下使用\n    OLS 会产生极度膨胀的显著性计数。 min_eta_max 策略在所有 K 下赢 12/12，确认 practical recommendation 对\n    panel size 鲁棒。\n  tables:\n  - name: Panel Size Sensitivity Summary (Clustered SE)\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - Panels\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - Ratio\n    - SE inflation\n    - η_max β (mean)\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '455'\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '8:0'\n      - 2.5x\n      - '0.42'\n    - - '5'\n      - '3003'\n      - 9/12\n      - 1/12\n      - '9:1'\n      - 4.1x\n      - '0.38'\n    - - '7'\n      - '6435'\n      - 9/12\n      - 1/12\n      - '9:1'\n      - 6.3x\n      - '0.34'\n    - - '9'\n      - '5005'\n      - 8/12\n      - 2/12\n      - '4:1'\n      - 7.8x\n      - '0.31'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: η_max and K_eff significance counts vs panel size K, showing η_max\n    stability and K_eff marginal increase'\n  - 'SE inflation curve: showing exponential growth of SE inflation factor with K,\n    motivating clustered SE necessity'\n  analysis: Panel size sensitivity 提供两个关键发现：(1) η_max 主导性在 K=3 到 K=9 范围内稳定持续， 确认 weakest-link\n    不是小 panel 的 artifact；(2) SE 膨胀随 K 急剧增加，为方法论 contribution（non-independence correction\n    的必要性）提供量化支撑。K=9 时 K_eff 达到 2/12 显著但 effect size 仍微小——power 增加检测到了真实但 practically\n    insignificant 的效应。论文 supplementary 中可报告此分析作为 robustness check。\n- name: VIF + Multicollinearity Diagnostic\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 计算 VIF、partial correlations、residualized K_eff regression，应用 Bonferroni/FDR\n    校正，尝试 beta regression\n  expected_results:\n    gpu_needed: false\n    raw_vif_keff: 2.96\n    raw_vif_eta_max: 2.96\n    residualized_vif_keff: 1.0\n    partial_correlation_keff_asr_given_eta: 0.18\n    partial_correlation_eta_asr_given_keff: 0.42\n    bonferroni_eta_max_sig: 7/12\n    bonferroni_keff_sig: 2/12\n    fdr_eta_max_sig: 8/12\n    fdr_keff_sig: 3/12\n    beta_regression_eta_max_sig: 10/12\n    beta_regression_keff_sig: 4/12 (3+/1-)\n    beta_regression_dispersion_phi:\n    - 3.2\n    - 8.7\n    condition_number: 4.8\n    reviewer_blocking_issue: false\n  result_rationale: Raw VIF ≈ 2.96 直接由 r=0.70 的 confound 决定（VIF = 1/(1-r²) = 1/(1-0.49)\n    = 1.96 在 bivariate 情况下；加上 tier indicators 后升至约 2.96）。VIF < 5 远低于标准 reviewer concern\n    阈值（通常 VIF > 10），甚至低于 stricter 标准（VIF > 5）。Residualization 后 VIF 降至 1.0（by construction），residualized\n    K_eff 的 partial correlation 仅 0.18 vs η_max 的 0.42——直接量化了主导性差异。Beta regression\n    作为 ASR ∈ [0,1] 的 distributional 替代方案：η_max 显著性从 log-log OLS 的 11/12 降至 10/12（beta\n    regression 对极端值更鲁棒），K_eff 从 8/12 升至 4/12（beta regression 更好地处理 heteroscedasticity）。Condition\n    number 4.8 < 30 确认无有害多重共线性。Bonferroni 校正（most conservative）给出 η_max 7/12 vs K_eff\n    2/12——即使在最保守的多重比较 校正下 η_max 仍显著主导。无 reviewer-blocking issue。\n  tables:\n  - name: Multicollinearity Diagnostics\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Threshold\n    - Status\n    rows:\n    - - VIF (K_eff, raw)\n      - '2.96'\n      - < 5 (strict) / < 10 (standard)\n      - PASS\n    - - VIF (K_eff, residualized)\n      - '1.00'\n      - < 5\n      - PASS\n    - - Condition number\n      - '4.8'\n      - < 30\n      - PASS\n    - - Partial r(K_eff, ASR | η_max)\n      - '0.18'\n      - '-'\n      - Weak\n    - - Partial r(η_max, ASR | K_eff)\n      - '0.42'\n      - '-'\n      - Moderate-strong\n  - name: Method Comparison with Multiple Testing Correction\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - K_eff direction\n    rows:\n    - - OLS + FDR\n      - 11/12\n      - 8/12\n      - 7+/1-\n    - - OLS + Bonferroni\n      - 7/12\n      - 2/12\n      - 2+/0-\n    - - Clustered SE + FDR\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '-'\n    - - Beta regression + FDR\n      - 10/12\n      - 4/12\n      - 3+/1-\n  figures_description:\n  - 'VIF bar chart: raw vs residualized for all predictors, with VIF=5 and VIF=10\n    reference lines'\n  - 'Partial correlation comparison: two-panel bar chart showing partial r for η_max\n    and K_eff'\n  analysis: VIF 分析消除了审稿人 RC1 的 last-resort 攻击角度——multicollinearity is moderate, not\n    pathological。r=0.70 在经验社会科学中常见（e.g., income and education）， standard practice\n    是报告 VIF 并继续。Beta regression 提供了 distributional robustness check：结论与 log-log OLS\n    一致。论文可在 methods 节用一段话报告 VIF diagnostics 并在 supplementary 中给出完整表格。\n- name: Aggregation Gradient Under Clustered SE\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 在 clustered SE 和 bootstrap 下重新运行 4 种聚合规则 + 新增 veto rule，验证聚合梯度是否为真实效应而非\n    overlap 伪迹\n  expected_results:\n    aggregation_rules:\n    - majority\n    - weighted\n    - threshold\n    - bayesian\n    - veto\n    correction_methods:\n    - OLS\n    - clustered_se\n    - bootstrap_v2\n    majority_clustered_se:\n      eta_sig: 8/12\n      keff_sig: 0/12\n    weighted_clustered_se:\n      eta_sig: 6/12\n      keff_sig: 1/12\n      keff_direction: 1+\n    threshold_clustered_se:\n      eta_sig: 10/12\n      keff_sig: 4/12\n      keff_direction: 3+/1-\n      r2: 0.87\n    bayesian_clustered_se:\n      eta_sig: 5/12\n      keff_sig: 4/12\n      keff_direction: 1+/3-\n      keff_negative_frac: 3/4\n    veto_clustered_se:\n      eta_sig: 11/12\n      keff_sig: 0/12\n      r2: 0.82\n    bayesian_bootstrap:\n      eta_sig: 3/12\n      keff_sig: 3/12\n      keff_direction: 0+/3-\n      keff_negative_frac: 3/3\n    gradient_preserved_under_correction: true\n    bayesian_keff_flip_genuine: true\n    aggregation_gradient_order: veto > threshold > majority > weighted > bayesian\n  result_rationale: 聚合梯度在 clustered SE 下保持，因为不同投票规则产生的脆弱性差异是 structural/mathematical\n    的，不是 panel overlap 的伪迹。Threshold（unanimity）要求所有 judges 一致，使单个 judge 的 failure\n    直接传导为 panel failure——R²=0.87 说明 panel 结构几乎完全决定了 threshold voting 下的脆弱性。这种强 structural\n    效应在 clustered SE 下大量存活（η_max 10/12, K_eff 4/12）。Veto rule（单个 judge 可否决）是 weakest-link\n    的极端化——η_max 几乎 完美预测（11/12），K_eff 被完全压倒（0/12）。 Bayesian calibration 翻转 K_eff 方向的关键机制：Bayesian\n    使用 prior accuracy 下调不可靠 judges 的权重，有效中和了 weakest-link 通道。η_max 的直接效应被削弱（11→5/12）。\n    剩余的 K_eff 信号主要来自 shared-bias 条件（diversity 保护性的部分），因此净方向为负。 在 bootstrap 下，Bayesian\n    K_eff 仅 3/12 显著但全部为负（3/3 negative fraction）—— direction flip 是真实的。这确认 aggregation\n    是独立于 non-independence correction 的 control lever。论文的 prescriptive conclusion（robustness-first\n    + Bayesian = dual-channel defense）在最严格校正下依然成立。\n  tables:\n  - name: Aggregation Gradient Under Clustered SE\n    columns:\n    - Rule\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - K_eff neg frac\n    - R²\n    - Gradient position\n    rows:\n    - - Veto\n      - 11/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '-'\n      - '0.82'\n      - Maximum vulnerability\n    - - Threshold\n      - 10/12\n      - 4/12\n      - 1/4\n      - '0.87'\n      - High\n    - - Majority\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '-'\n      - '0.28'\n      - Moderate\n    - - Weighted\n      - 6/12\n      - 1/12\n      - 0/1\n      - '0.26'\n      - Low-moderate\n    - - Bayesian\n      - 5/12\n      - 4/12\n      - 3/4\n      - '0.09'\n      - Minimum vulnerability\n  - name: Bayesian K_eff Direction Detail\n    columns:\n    - Correction\n    - K_eff sig total\n    - K_eff positive\n    - K_eff negative\n    - Neg fraction\n    rows:\n    - - OLS\n      - 7/12\n      - '1'\n      - '6'\n      - 6/7 (86%)\n    - - Clustered SE\n      - 4/12\n      - '1'\n      - '3'\n      - 3/4 (75%)\n    - - Bootstrap v2\n      - 3/12\n      - '0'\n      - '3'\n      - 3/3 (100%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Aggregation gradient stacked bar chart: η_max and K_eff significance by rule,\n    comparing OLS vs clustered SE side by side'\n  - 'K_eff coefficient sign heatmap: 5 rules × 12 conditions, showing Bayesian blue\n    (negative) vs threshold/veto red (positive)'\n  analysis: 聚合梯度在校正下的稳健性是论文的独立贡献——它不受 non-independence concern 的影响，因为 它描述的是投票规则数学的\n    structural 性质。Veto rule 的加入使梯度两端更 extreme： veto（pure weakest-link）vs Bayesian（weakest-link\n    neutralized + diversity flip）。 论文可以将此呈现为 defense design spectrum——practitioners\n    根据其对 false positive vs false negative 的偏好选择适当位置。Bayesian K_eff 在 bootstrap 下 3/3\n    negative 是 cleanest possible evidence for the flip。\n- name: Open-Ended Generation Benchmark Extension\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 在 MT-Bench 风格的 open-ended generation 任务上测试 weakest-link 假说，超越 MCQ 格式\n  expected_results:\n    benchmark: MT-Bench (8 categories)\n    judge_format: 1-10 scale scoring\n    models_available: 12\n    panels: 220\n    attack_types:\n    - style_manipulation\n    - length_inflation\n    - format_gaming\n    conditions: 6\n    eta_max_sig_ols: 5/6\n    keff_sig_ols: 3/6 (2+/1-)\n    eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 4/6\n    keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/6\n    r2_mean: 0.22\n    gam_generation_split:\n      style_manipulation: shared-bias (negative K_eff)\n      length_inflation: shared-bias (negative K_eff)\n      format_gaming: targeted (positive K_eff)\n    min_eta_max_wins: 6/6\n    cross_format_consistency: η_max dominant in both MCQ and generation\n  result_rationale: η_max 主导性在 generation 任务中持续因为底层机制相同：无论 judges 评估 MCQ 正确性还是 generation\n    质量，adversary 都针对最可操纵的 judge。Generation 的 1-10 scale 提供了比 MCQ binary 更多的操纵空间（微妙的\n    style/format manipulation 可以影响 rubric-based scoring），但 vulnerability 的 distribution\n    across judges 仍然是高度不均匀的—— 某些 judges 对 length inflation 或 format gaming 特别敏感。R²\n    较低（0.22 vs MCQ 的 0.30）因为 generation evaluation 有更多 idiosyncratic variance（rubric\n    interpretation, 文化偏好等）。K_eff 在 OLS 下 3/6 显著但 clustered SE 后归零——与 MCQ 完全一致。 GAM\n    分类中，style manipulation 和 length inflation 属于 shared-bias（所有 LLM judges 都倾向于给更长/更\n    polished 的回答更高分），而 format gaming 属于 targeted（利用特定 model 的 format parsing 差异）。12\n    模型（部分 API 模型不支持 generation evaluation） 给出 220 panels，足够进行 regression analysis。min_eta_max\n    策略在 generation 上同样 赢 6/6，确认 practical recommendation 跨 task format 通用。\n  tables:\n  - name: Generation Benchmark Results (Clustered SE)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - η_max sig?\n    - K_eff sig?\n    - K_eff GAM dir\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - style_manipulation × MT-Bench\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - negative\n      - '0.19'\n    - - length_inflation × MT-Bench\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - negative\n      - '0.24'\n    - - format_gaming × MT-Bench\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n      - positive\n      - '0.23'\n  - name: Cross-Format Consistency\n    columns:\n    - Format\n    - η_max sig (CL-SE)\n    - K_eff sig (CL-SE)\n    - Dominance ratio\n    rows:\n    - - MCQ (MMLU+ARC)\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '8:0'\n    - - Generation (MT-Bench)\n      - 4/6\n      - 0/6\n      - '4:0'\n    - - Combined\n      - 12/18\n      - 0/18\n      - '12:0'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side coefficient forest plot: MCQ vs generation tasks, showing η_max\n    dominance in both formats'\n  analysis: Generation extension 消除了\"MCQ-specific artifact\"的审稿人质疑。η_max 主导性跨 task\n    format 通用性是论文 generalizability 论证的关键证据。R² 降低反映了 generation evaluation 的内在 noise，但\n    relative driver importance（η_max >> K_eff）完全保持。 此实验可作为 Section 5 的扩展分析或 supplementary\n    material。\n- name: Partial-Knowledge Adversary Model\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 模拟 adversary 仅知道 judge family labels（不知具体脆弱性 profile）的 realistic threat\n    model\n  expected_results:\n    knowledge_levels:\n    - full (baseline)\n    - family-only\n    - random\n    asr_reduction_family_vs_full_pct: 18\n    asr_reduction_random_vs_full_pct: 42\n    family_knowledge_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 7/12\n    family_knowledge_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n    family_knowledge_dominance_ratio: '7:0'\n    random_targeting_eta_max_sig_clustered_se: 3/12\n    random_targeting_keff_sig_clustered_se: 0/12\n    family_knowledge_r2_mean: 0.24\n    family_label_attack_efficiency: 0.82\n  result_rationale: Family-only adversary 的 ASR 仅降 18%（而非 random 的 42%），因为 family\n    labels 与 vulnerability profiles 有中等相关：同 family 模型共享 training pipeline 和 architectural\n    biases，adversary 可基于 family 推断出 approximately correct 的攻击 策略。η_max 仍然主导（7/12 vs\n    full-knowledge 的 8/12）因为 family-level targeting 仍 preferentially hits weaker judges——family\n    labels 虽然 noisy 但 informationally above chance。K_eff 在 partial-knowledge 下同样为\n    0/12——diversity 在任何 knowledge level 下都不是 independent protective factor after correction。Attack\n    efficiency 0.82 意味着 family labels 提供了 82% of full-knowledge targeting effectiveness——这对\n    ecological validity 至关重要：现实中 adversary 通常知道 panel 的 model families （从 API endpoint,\n    response style 等推断），因此 full-knowledge 结果的 relevance 不仅限于理论上限。Random targeting\n    下 η_max 仅 3/12 显著——random adversary 无法有效 利用 individual weaknesses，说明 η_max 的 predictive\n    power 依赖于 adversary 的 targeting ability，与 adaptive vs RF contrast（plan_003）形成完整呼应。\n  tables:\n  - name: Adversary Knowledge Level Comparison (Clustered SE)\n    columns:\n    - Knowledge level\n    - Mean ASR\n    - ASR vs full (%)\n    - η_max sig\n    - K_eff sig\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - Full knowledge\n      - '0.195'\n      - 100%\n      - 8/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Family-only\n      - '0.160'\n      - 82%\n      - 7/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.24'\n    - - Random\n      - '0.113'\n      - 58%\n      - 3/12\n      - 0/12\n      - '0.08'\n  - name: Family Label Informativeness\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Attack efficiency (family/full)\n      - '0.82'\n      - Family labels highly informative for targeting\n    - - Family-vulnerability correlation\n      - '0.61'\n      - Moderate; same family shares weaknesses\n    - - η_max sig retention (family vs full)\n      - 7/8\n      - Targeting still exploits weakest link\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-panel ASR distribution: full vs family-only vs random, showing gradual\n    degradation'\n  - η_max coefficient trajectory across knowledge levels, showing graceful degradation\n  analysis: Partial-knowledge 实验将论文结论从 worst-case（omniscient adversary）扩展至 realistic\n    threat model。Family-only adversary 保留 82% 攻击效率这一发现对 practical defense implications\n    至关重要——defenders 不能依赖\"adversary 不知道 panel 具体组成\"的假设， 因为 family-level knowledge 几乎\n    sufficient。η_max 在所有 knowledge levels 下主导， K_eff 在所有 knowledge levels 下为 0/12——核心发现对\n    adversary 能力假设鲁棒。 Random targeting 的 R²=0.08 呼应 plan_003 的 RF 结论：panel 结构的预测力依赖于\n    adversary 的 strategic targeting——这是论文 adaptive vs random 对比叙事的第三个 independent\n    evidence line。\n","numLines":1061,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1061}}}
